# FlowLock Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# Because this frontend is a client-side static web application, configuration is managed in:
# frontend/env.js
#
# To link your Render backend to the Vercel frontend:
# 1. Open frontend/env.js
# 2. Set API_BASE_URL to your Render backend URL, for example:
#    API_BASE_URL: 'https://your-app-name.onrender.com/api'
#
# Alternatively, you can test different backends at runtime in browser console via:
#    localStorage.setItem('flowlock_api_url', 'https://your-app-name.onrender.com/api')
